{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/42960-lunars-with-or-without-castes-aspects","id":42960,"title":"Lunars with or without Castes/Aspects","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-05T10:15:12-08:00","id":42960,"title":"Lunars with or without Castes/Aspects","content":"Mr. Morke wanted to discuss Aspects versus Castes for Lunars.<br /> <br /> This thread can host that discussion, if people want.<br /> <br /> I guess I am just throwing a few ideas out, just to get them out of my head and maybe spark conversation. If we are deconstructing Lunars, why not go a little bit further?<br /> <br /> I am going to come out and say that if Lunars are consummate outsiders and iconoclasts, I do not think that they should have a 'Caste' or 'Aspect' at all.<br /> <br /> What I feel is gained:<br /> <br /> 1. Outsiders- A whole host of Exalted who are each an outsider or 'the other' yet they arrange themselves in castes and orders? How can you really represent the outsider if there are another 100 more or less like you, serving the same purpose? I am not sure that the Lunar thematics lend themselves into Castes/ASpects<br /> <br /> 2. Each a reflection of a different aspect of the ever changing goddess.<br /> <br /> 3. The Lunar Castes are atrocious. I have faith that the Developers recognize this issue, and were going to do something about it. But, why not just give every Lunar 3-4 favored abilities, and design the charms with the knowledge that yes, most Lunar player characters are going to favor Dexterity? My Cat Totem ninja lunar can have Dexterity, Wits, and Appearance. He doesn't go big into DBT or the like. He can transform into any number of human forms, and assume any number of guises, spy, infiltrate, and then eliminate threats. The build is what I want it to be, and the character is tightly bound to its concept.<br /> <br /> What is lost/gambled<br /> <br /> 1. There might be some flavor loss here, a disconnection from other Lunars and a further loss of cohesion in the Exalted type. I do not know how catastrophic the loss would be.<br /> <br /> 2. Potential for Abuse. Lunars would probably become the favorites of the white rooms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1199-mister-lion","name":"Mister Lion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1199_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T15:05:35-08:00","id":43152,"title":"","content":"Lunars without Castes or Aspects would...<br /> <br /> * Work somewhat like Devil Tigers , only they don't get to create a whole new set of unique and off-limits Charms. They might, however, be able to use their fully-customizeable &quot;Caste&quot; (ie: Totem) to monkey around with the Lunar Charmset through keywords that might let them learn some Charm cascades out of order.<br /> <br /> * As you say, decide their favored Attributes based on their Totem (Totemic Attributes). A player who wants to design a combat-focused Lunar would pick the Attributes which offer the combat Charms which most appeal to him. Since combat Charms can be found under social and mental Attributes, this need not be a purely physical character.<br /> <br /> * Lose out on Caste/Aspect-specific Anima Powers, but the Spirit Shape (being derived from the Totem) is a Totem-specific Anima Power, and Heart's Blood Shapeshifting is still one of the best Anima Powers in the game.<br /> <br /> * Lose out on Castelessness, which no one ever really cared about because it sucked. But the Lunars will still have Chimerism as an option they can deliberately pursue if they want to opt out of their &quot;Caste&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":636,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","user":"Sunder the Gold","date":". 01-05-2014, 06:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T17:35:27-08:00","id":43241,"title":"","content":"Seems like a very good suggestion to me. I'm behind it wholeheartedly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1551-barefoot-monkey","name":"Barefoot Monkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1551_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T20:04:41-08:00","id":43299,"title":"","content":"I actually think this is a pretty good idea. My main worry would be the fact that it draws away from the moon iconography a bit much and would make them (even more then they all ready are) the Animal Exalted.<br /> <br /> Find a way to highlight the Lunar part of the Lunar Exalted with this system and I think it would be perfect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/477-xenorath","name":"Xenorath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"169"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-07T14:51:01-08:00","id":44452,"title":"","content":"Duplicate thread, see <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/42951-lunars-castes-or-aspects\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...tes-or-aspects</a> . As that one is longer, let's move the discussion over there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/240-winged-cat","name":"Winged Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar240_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"129"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}